g potters create a trio of character gnomes, before guest judge Adam Keeling sets them the task of making a sea kale forcer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cIWoRD86yLdYrAlFTX00X9Zf8iC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-30\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"1960s Glazed Vessels and Repeating Patterns\",\"overview\":\"It's back to the Swinging Sixties, as the potters create a psychedelic pair of highly decorative glazed vessels, before guest judge Orla Kiely tests their repeating-pattern skills.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vbn79l1H0ocM35QNPTARF03rZAi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-06\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Wildlife Week and Hand-Built Table Lamps\",\"overview\":\"It's Wildlife Week and the potters hand-build a table lamp, go wild in a Throw Down first, and get a surprise visit from a familiar face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iQOQt8KFy7U4FKzVUGFnD9lrGIC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-13\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Self-Sculpture, Sawdust Kilns and Candlesticks\",\"overview\":\"Siobhán McSweeney's back, as the remaining potters create a self-sculpture, build their own sawdust kilns and make candlesticks under pressure, for a place in the semi-final.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yLPu4f6q8cleMcMzSsafQta7QeT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-20\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Urinals and Wedgwood Jasperware\",\"overview\":\"It's the semi-final and the potters are left feeling flushed as they make fully functional urinals, before recreating the iconic Wedgwood Jasperware, for a place in the final.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nucXNYDg8ARJX6l5Isoj43uTBAC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-27\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Final: Garden Totem Sculpture and a Devil's Work Challenge\",\"overview\":\"The potters make a garden totem sculpture that tells their life story, followed by a regal devil's work challenge set by Rich Miller, before the winner is crowned.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1KqnmBoBIJSdBYI8jwBkopFOtzq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-06\",\"runtime\":57}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-11-03\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}